   "original": "U.S. Department of Transportation Federal Aviation Administration — Operations Specifications — A003. Ratings and Limitations — HQ Control: 12/16/98 HQ Revision: 00c — The Certificate Holder is authorized the following Ratings and/or Limitations: Class Ratings: Radio Class 1: Communications Equipment; Radio Class 2: Navigational Equipment; Radio Class 3: Radar Equipment. Limited Ratings: Rating: Accessories | Manufacturer: From the Approved Capabilities List | Make/Model: Current Revision | Limitations: N/A. Limited Ratings - Specialized Services: Rating: None Authorized | Specifications: N/A | Limitations: N/A. 1. Issued by the Federal Aviation Administration. 2. These Operations Specifications are approved by direction of the Administrator. Schmidt, Gordon, Principal Avionics Inspector, SO19. 3. Date Approval is effective: 1/22/03. Amendment Number: 2. 4. I hereby accept and receive the Operations Specifications in this paragraph. Hernandez, Alexis R., General Manager, Date: 1/22/03. Print Date: 1/28/2003. A003-1. Confidence Aviation, Inc. Certificate No.: V9DR072Y.",
